# Install the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) in VS Code,
# then click "Send Request" above any line starting with ###.

### 1. Get orders (goes through the repository and the database)
GET http://localhost:5081/api/orders

### 2. Show current chaos settings
GET http://localhost:5081/chaos

### 3. Database flaky: 50% timeouts (default)
POST http://localhost:5081/chaos/db/50

### 4. Database fully down: 100% timeouts
POST http://localhost:5081/chaos/db/100

### 5. Database healthy: 0% timeouts
POST http://localhost:5081/chaos/db/0
